

  Bounty task toolbar
    ✔ shows only search, ability filter and accessible refresh in the embedded toolbar (76ms)
    ✔ retains the shared creation entry for other callers, not a hidden toolbar toggle
    ✔ gives toolbar controls independent grid cells and restores complete form field styles

  exact requirement/reference create contract
    ✔ preserves long Unicode/null/empty original text without task_plan truncation or latest substitution
    ✔ allows empty references and canonicalizes only exact selection ordering
    ✔ rejects duplicate rather than silently filtering material
    ✔ rejects wrong purpose rather than silently filtering material
    ✔ rejects fractional version rather than silently filtering material
    ✔ rejects out-of-INT version rather than silently filtering material
    ✔ rejects fake owner rather than silently filtering material
    ✔ rejects latest marker rather than silently filtering material
    ✔ rejects too many refs rather than silently filtering material
    ✔ cannot reinterpret owner as ordinary task creation authority
    ✔ cannot reinterpret tenantId as ordinary task creation authority
    ✔ cannot reinterpret grossBountyAmountMicro as ordinary task creation authority
    ✔ cannot reinterpret grantId as ordinary task creation authority
    ✔ cannot reinterpret targetAgentId as ordinary task creation authority
    ✔ cannot reinterpret costAuthorizationRef as ordinary task creation authority
    ✔ persists actual NUL-separated scope, encoding keys and isolating owners
    ✔ never overwrites unresolved key/body or accepts null-body/future-schema records
    ✔ rejects mismatching media/task receipt; exact verified receipt is required to settle
    ✔ POSTs one atomic operation, not independent legacy task/link writes
    ✔ double-clicks or payload edits in flight cannot replace fixed body/key
    ✔ network-unknown POST retains original and blocks new-key create
    ✔ remount only GETs; unknown 404 never clears or silently replays
    ✔ known committed receipt only GETs even when explicitly resumed
    ✔ fences late POST at scope boundary
    ✔ fences late POST at epoch boundary
    ✔ fences late POST at dispose boundary
    ✔ corrupt/unavailable records and failed write readback are never absent/writable
    ✔ cleanup failure retains known committed receipt and never creates another operation
    ✔ incompatible/grant-looking responses never acknowledge successful task creation
    ✔ existing point-and-start actually reads original intent with real Hall namespace

  actual JuyiHall default requirement entry
    ✔ uses the ordinary requirement form under the multimedia UI flag without creating, selecting an agent, or starting a provider
    ✔ keeps the pre-flag private-draft route and blocks all routing while a guarded draft remains active
    ✔ wires every explicit default 提出需求 entry to the guarded formal requirement route

  actual JuyiHall ordinary/funded boundary
    ✔ uses atomic ordinary creation and separate funded route with definitive acknowledgements
    ✔ cannot replace PRESENT ordinary intent via funded creation
    ✔ cannot replace CORRUPT ordinary intent via funded creation
    ✔ cannot replace UNAVAILABLE ordinary intent via funded creation
    ✔ does not mix references with funding or bypass unresolved funded-create recovery
    ✔ compiles actual changed SFCs and wires exact recovery handlers (554ms)

  mounted Bounty requirement draft and original recovery
    ✔ opens the exposed ordinary requirement form without creating a task or starting execution
    ✔ leaves an embedded task detail before exposing the ordinary requirement form without creating or starting execution
    ✔ Hall detail consistently uses multimedia discussion rather than a separate PDF execution entry (74ms)
    ✔ submits optional exact reference selection from the real pre-task form; no guessed taskId
    ✔ allows a no-reference draft and retains edited text/reference after an older success
    ✔ identity changes clear the old draft and late acknowledgement cannot clear a new actor draft
    ✔ shows immutable unknown original refs and emits explicit check/resume instead of resubmitting current draft
    ✔ never submits hidden ordinary refs as a funded draft

